# Play test of Old Mine Islet (CIPlay old_mine_islet, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Old Mine Islet
expect step 0
expect title Down the Old Mine

# The yard in front of the mine: the notice, the miner's locker with the head lamp
walk 20 -10 to 21 -19 h=4.9
zone minehead
expect step 1
read Mine notice
expect step 2
open Miner's locker
expect item HeadLight 1
expect step 3

# Into the mine along the rails: the beast wakes at the deep end
walk 20 -17.4 to 12 -17.4 to 2 -17.4 h=5.2
zone deep
expect message grunts in the dark
expect step 4
kill Warthog
expect step 5
expect animals Warthog 0

# To the end of the line: the last ore cart
walk 2 -17.4 to -8.5 -17.4 h=6.5
open Last ore cart
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_MetalDetector 1
expect done
